<http://data.silknow.org/object/e6c21bca-907c-3adb-8bd3-d17f7b794c72/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Three rows with various architectural and landscape views, birds perched on branches naturalistic floral groupings etc. Central in the top row is a wreath with the initials \"MS\" and the date. Beneath these motives, separated by a spiraling horizontal line, are script and gothic alphabets plus numbers and a band of \"Greek Key\" designs. Repeating floral motif border. Many nail holes around outer edge. Stitches: cross"@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/e6c21bca-907c-3adb-8bd3-d17f7b794c72> .

